I found two separate runnable components in the repository: the Visual ChatGPT Gradio app at the root and a Docker-based Low-code LLM demo under `LowCodeLLM/`. The visual app also imports GroundingDINO and Segment Anything modules that aren’t included in this checkout, so I’ll document that setup limitation rather than imply the listed requirements alone provide a turnkey install.
Created `README.md` in the repository root. It documents the two demos, their setup and launch instructions, Visual ChatGPT’s external module limitation, related papers, and licensing notes. No tests were run; only documentation was added.

